SUMMARY:Casual Ride (D) - EP Penn Run Ride (33R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: open\nAntici
 pated Average Pace for D rides: (12-14 mph)\nRoute: [Penn Run](https://rou
 tes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/ep-penn-run-ride-33r/)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun
 \, and Ride Together**\n\nThis is a Casual D Class ride. The ride leader w
 ill ride at the advertised average speed. This is intended to be a group r
 ide with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her 
 best to keep the group together with occasional regroupings and/or splitti
 ng into multiple groups to align to pace capabilities.\n\nPlease do not jo
 in this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If you exceed 
 the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged to join a 
 faster group. If maintaining a 12-14 mph average is beyond your current ab
 ility level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n\nHelmets are 
 mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tu
 be\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pe
 n and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below 
 to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Jo
 in here [Member Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pag
 e_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the clu
 b's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/c
 ontent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an 
 incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.
 aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3152826
 10/
